---
// Craft.astro
// "Made Different" section — homemade spices & authentic craft story
// Appears after the Marquee, before OilTruth
---

<section class="craft-section" id="craft">
  <div class="craft-inner">

    <!-- Left: heading + story -->
    <div class="craft-left">
      <div class="craft-tag">
        <span>✦</span> Crafted Differently
      </div>
      <h2 class="craft-hl">
        Market brands buy their spices.<br/>
        <em>We grind ours at home.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="craft-body">
        Every major namkeen brand you know sources pre-mixed, industrial masala from a
        packet — the same packet used by dozens of other companies. The flavor is
        <strong>standardised, not crafted.</strong>
      </p>
      <p class="craft-body">
        At Hariram Namkeen, our spice blends are ground fresh in our own kitchen —
        the same way it has been done for generations in Muzaffarnagar. No shortcuts.
        No outsourced masala. <em>Just real spices, real hands, real taste.</em>
      </p>

      <div class="craft-differentiators">
        <div class="craft-diff-item">
          <div class="craft-diff-icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--maroon)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2v4"/><path d="M4.93 10.93a10 10 0 0 0 14.14 0"/><path d="M12 6a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 3 2 5.5 5 7.5 1 .67 3 .67 4 0 3-2 5-4.5 5-7.5a7 7 0 0 0-7-7z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Fresh-ground masala</strong>
            <span>Spices ground in-house daily, never from commercial packets</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="craft-diff-item">
          <div class="craft-diff-icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--maroon)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 3h8v3H8z"/><rect x="5" y="6" width="14" height="15" rx="3"/><path d="M10 11v6"/><path d="M14 11v6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>No industrial shortcuts</strong>
            <span>We reject mass-market pre-mixes and artificial flavor boosters</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="craft-diff-item">
          <div class="craft-diff-icon">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--maroon)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 9h12a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2a8 8 0 0 1-16 0v-2a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"/><path d="M9 2l3 7"/><path d="M8 21h8"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>Generations of craft</strong>
            <span>Heritage recipes perfected slow over open flame kadhais</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right: visual preview + quote -->
    <div class="craft-right">
      <div class="craft-visual-stack">
        <div class="craft-img-card">
          <img src="/images/top_angle_masala_chana_dal.png" alt="Handcrafted Masala Chana Dal in Pure Mustard Oil" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="craft-img-badge">✦ 100% In-House Spices & Mustard Oil</div>
        </div>
        <div class="craft-quote">
          <span class="craft-quote-mark">"</span>
          Premium does not mean expensive packaging —
          it means <em>nothing fake inside the packet.</em>
          <span class="craft-quote-attr">— Hariram Namkeen</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
